From: VIKINGYFY <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:21:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] responses: treat cyber policy refusal as a request error

Recognize the provider policy code in both raw HTTP errors and transformed
stream errors. Keep these refusals out of retries and model circuit-breaker
failure accounting while preserving the provider error details.

Base-Commit: c5795678840ee54ecdef8f03f9741650bd8ab302

